<rss xmlns:ns0="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>罗翔说刑法 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/517327498</link><ns0:link href="http://rss.materium.io/bilibili/user/video/517327498" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><description>罗翔说刑法 的 bilibili 空间 - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><image><url>https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/face/4e5d0a51273fe3f8fabc700b6a71bb8a38c9e21e.jpg</url><title>罗翔说刑法 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/517327498</link></image><lastBuildDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 20:35:06 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>【罗翔】张三下药迷晕妻子发生关系，算性侵吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117209523296420&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1M8bF69E43" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/747ab03ad154f0b551b4c285d9749d8ece059438.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;法律虽然无法强迫夫妻之间的彼此尊重，但是必须要捍卫底线的道德。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1M8bF69E43</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1M8bF69E43</guid><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】律师为什么要为千夫所指之人辩护？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117131576350156&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Ti8M61EY3" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8d60946a9570c10d72fc2e779f22321a3a987490.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;最近有部热播剧叫做《重器》，里面谈到了律师制度，正如影片中袁律师所说：律师制度是中国法制不可或缺的一部分。律师不是法院和检察院的对立面和敌人。我们和他们一起构成了中国法制的主体”。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ti8M61EY3</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ti8M61EY3</guid><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 04:25:26 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】七夕谈谈冷冻胚胎案和婚姻里“塞壬的诱惑”</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117115973605312&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Np8u65EBH" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/93e25ed646ae02ad651cc64784cc020e3ed0aa4d.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;今天是七夕，想从奥德修斯联想一下近日的冷冻胚胎案。今日之我可以撤销昨日之我吗？很多时候，只有神圣的道德戒律才能让我们经过海妖出没的领域，避免欲望的无限泛滥所带来的灾难性后果。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Np8u65EBH</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Np8u65EBH</guid><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】《历史》里那些炫耀幸福的人，后来都怎么样了...</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117093659975564&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1QcgP6sEPW" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5b4a88afe3a0c204e8b47916ee0576dd0dfd0476.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;希罗多德《历史》的开端就是从人类悲剧性的炫耀开始写起，幸运不代表幸福。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QcgP6sEPW</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QcgP6sEPW</guid><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】一份医疗事故无罪判决书</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117075490119225&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Jouq6wEq5" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/08f05d5bef3ab21db3293e09ae02ae6ef7be588a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;最近在研究医疗事故罪，发现有份二审改判无罪的判决书写的很有深度，值得学习。任何法律概念在指向具体事物的时候，都会出现判断的难题。在不少案件中，医疗事故罪的“严重不负责任”其实不太好判断，有时实践往往走在理论之前。 。 参考文献： 1. 李丞铭：《解释向度与规范释义：论医疗过失的“严重不负责任”》， 《南京医科大学学报（社会科学版）》2025年第5期 2. 苏雄华、王慧芳：《医疗事故罪“严重不负责任”的认定》，《卫生法学》2025年第1期 3. 于佳佳：《医疗资源配置不均衡对医疗过失认定的影响》</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Jouq6wEq5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Jouq6wEq5</guid><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 06:39:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】老子才是法家的宗师！无为而治vs大开杀戒</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117053310637183&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1x8ub6mEAQ" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bbcc918b27797f5ecb8051f1a986deb10fad8e05.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;其实一直以来我都有一个疑惑，就是司马迁为什么把老子和韩非凑在一起，写了老子韩非列传。按照道理他们应该是完全不同路数的人，一个强调消极的无为，一个强调积极的有为。感觉有点像石头记说的“假作真时真亦假,无为有时有还无”。 参考文献：1.马小红：《论法家之“法”》，《管子研究》2024年第4期，第18页。 2.马小红：《“软法”定义: 从传统的“礼法合治” 中寻求法的共识》，《政法论坛》2017年第1期，第24页。 3.俞荣根：《现代法治非法家之治》，《湖湘法学评论》2022年第3期，第12页。 4.陈德中：《</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1x8ub6mEAQ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1x8ub6mEAQ</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 08:41:39 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】蛇逃逸，业主张三大爷午夜惊魂……</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=117006082907687&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1uS3W67EQb" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/86969335549bf8ae778ce616c80efd30409eaa33.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;很多人觉得在家养蛇是个人自由，实则暗藏多重法律风险。自由必有边界，个人爱好不能妨害他人的生活安宁与生命安全。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uS3W67EQb</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uS3W67EQb</guid><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】老人见义勇为被咬掉鼻子：法律该如何鼓励行善？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116962914999901&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1WmgC6xEYw" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6c3e098ee4359f0352954fd34d9f628a067dc47f.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;从湖南一位年近 70 岁老人见义勇为被咬掉鼻子的事件说起，聊聊 “见危不救” 是否应当入刑，法律与道德的边界在哪里，我们又该用制度保护每一个行善的普通人。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WmgC6xEYw</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WmgC6xEYw</guid><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>幼年被继父性侵，时隔20年还能追诉吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116923153062893&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1KDNq6aEq5" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/92ca2c71e7e7ea0afbbc22ba9058ad22cca5acb9.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;有人小时候遭亲属性侵，长大维权却卡在追诉时效。这期结合79 刑法、97 刑法及相关司法解释，讲一讲性侵犯罪的追诉时效问题。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1KDNq6aEq5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1KDNq6aEq5</guid><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2026 09:03:18 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】黄牛张三抢票、篡改志愿、入侵机器人，这是犯罪吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116882283765174&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV15oMi6JEeX" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4f325b3a891d5b0f306a87d805591d75dddb1002.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;计算机犯罪都有哪些类型？操纵别人家的扫地机器人摄像头实行偷窥，该当何罪？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15oMi6JEeX</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15oMi6JEeX</guid><pubDate>Wed, 08 Jul 2026 03:47:40 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】张三“网购-退货-掉包-致富”，一顿操作该当何罪？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116818983263136&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1X27J6WE5t" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ba0a86c5ebcde059e7262d57f7bd870229f79cf4.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;法律问题并不像数学一样，它无法做到精准，也许它只能满足理性有限的人类对于相对合理性的认同。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1X27J6WE5t</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1X27J6WE5t</guid><pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】张三烧炭赴死未遂还是犯罪吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116769289211956&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1NiLf6mEHf" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/543654ffe3c49c27b59a95d2b3be8eadc75f955e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;张三为爱烧炭自杀，自杀未遂，这是犯罪吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NiLf6mEHf</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NiLf6mEHf</guid><pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 04:49:06 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】张三抢劫高考试卷，该当何罪?</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116701727366980&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1qU7U61EeB" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/438aa84c8483bf06c4aabecea09426542623db42.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;-</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qU7U61EeB</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qU7U61EeB</guid><pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】嫉妒使人面目全非，我们应该如何面对嫉妒？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116672702782428&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1keV96dEeu" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5ae099c74b53f481c3560aa951888a4d418ebf3f.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;我们可能不得不承认，我们都是命运中小小的配角。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1keV96dEeu</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1keV96dEeu</guid><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 03:30:51 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】“穿完即退”的吊牌族违法吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116637453784558&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1jgVc6aEaW" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/714134f3b4ef8156234b8511324b88ec7c10608a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;吊牌族的行为构成破坏生产经营罪吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jgVc6aEaW</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jgVc6aEaW</guid><pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】泥鳅钓鱼是否构成犯罪？给大家汇报最近写的学术论文</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116614636772248&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1YgLa6SEPt" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/77047cf379bc514271d2573fad1958eed43bf6e8.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;在这个视频里学不到打窝、垂钓的技巧，但是能看到一次论文答辩。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YgLa6SEPt</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YgLa6SEPt</guid><pubDate>Fri, 22 May 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】去世的表弟深夜来电，午夜惊魂案情与法律分析</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116581015229956&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Qf5z6KEXu" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/80d0362c9961825dc249700d216ba6b47449899b.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;刑法学界一直有过盗窃死者财物应该如何定性的问题，今天我们借这个离谱的真实案例，好好聊一聊。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qf5z6KEXu</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qf5z6KEXu</guid><pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】张三薅公司差旅的羊毛，薅多少算职务侵占？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116563701210509&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1es5V6eESg" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/05c2b18c1e0140734c62aab06f6bf78196ed26b4.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;张三在大企业工作，经常出差，每次出差都可以住五星级酒店。所以张三就想从这做文章，薅公司一些羊毛，但是张三最近焦虑了，因为听说这种行为可能构成犯罪。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1es5V6eESg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1es5V6eESg</guid><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>鲁豫对话罗翔：在命运的剧本揭晓前，尽力扮演好自己的角色 | 陈鲁豫·慢谈EP16【视频播客】</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116457685912801&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1zNoVB1EWb" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7ca7413420ad96404e0a947ef957c44a98625f68.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;他是拥有超3200万粉丝的“顶流”老师，从“一夜爆红”到主动收敛锋芒，成名的光环之下，藏着数不尽数的惶恐与紧张。 本期《陈鲁豫·慢谈》，鲁豫对话罗翔，从年少经历谈到人生底色，从法学思辨聊至内心矛盾。在这场沉静对话里，我们看见撕掉网络标签后，一个更真实、更完整的罗翔。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zNoVB1EWb</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zNoVB1EWb</guid><pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>读书究竟让人越读越聪明，还是越读越傲慢？｜罗翔x刘震云x刘旸教主【2026读书日特别策划】</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116445589543483&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1hkoHBpENz" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/904642290ba50b9c0f8e604e17959be55f7a39ec.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;又是一年一度世界读书日，《一麦三连》邀请到三位重磅嘉宾：百大UP主@罗翔说刑法 、知名作家刘震云、知名喜剧演员@刘旸教主 ，一起来聊聊读书，又不止于读书。我们希望借这样一场对话，由读书切入，聊聊这世间的「道理」——因为书本只是道理的其中一种传播形态。上课、喜剧创作、写小说、和生活里的朋友聊天，都是在「讲道理」。而不管读多少本书，书里的道理，总是要被拿去面对生活的问题。读的书越多，人就一定越能看清楚生活吗？有时候，相比道理，玩笑的力量、幽默的力量反而更能成为我们抵抗荒诞的武器。愿我们都能从书本、从生活里汲取</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hkoHBpENz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hkoHBpENz</guid><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】刑法的基本原则也可能冲突？罪刑法定和罪刑均衡原则会冲突吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116366300419344&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ZbDzBYEzL" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/eb4a666b715f204fa8397d8188d3f822be8f6000.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;当罪刑法定与罪刑均衡冲突怎么办？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZbDzBYEzL</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZbDzBYEzL</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>人文十问，快问快答</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116315834554585&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV12FXoBPEKE" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e4e90a41965fccbcd9f3952161b8ff04789f0c1e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;收到十个问题，做了一个简单的回答。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12FXoBPEKE</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12FXoBPEKE</guid><pubDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>愚人的请教</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116326521772760&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1bx9VBHEsy" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f83a076cc90bafdb2b2d2ee056a9fdceb7f0871e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;今天愚人节，作为愚蠢渺小的我想请教大家一个法律问题。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bx9VBHEsy</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bx9VBHEsy</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 02:10:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】给企业打差评属于损害商业信誉、商品声誉罪吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116275351265104&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1y4QQB7E4J" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8ec5f1817b92162e37f6c983e145cde588511fc1.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;个人有名誉，企业自然也有商誉。个人的名誉权，与企业的商誉权，哪个更值得保护呢？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1y4QQB7E4J</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1y4QQB7E4J</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Mar 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】闹市公然发生不雅行为，算寻衅滋事还是传播淫秽物品？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116275334420544&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1WtQQB2EJx" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7b46d7023710d979e9aeff0918e1dd1b8e98cab2.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;对公然发生不雅行为的处罚的根据应该是冒犯原则，也即侵犯了不想看不想听的人的自由，但很多时候，现场的吃瓜群众没有感到冒犯，甚至还起哄，所以，发生这种事情，到底应该怎么判断？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WtQQB2EJx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WtQQB2EJx</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Mar 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】清末四大疑案之杨乃武与小白菜案</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116255252092910&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1J8w1z7EpH" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/55f8bb5c2e3897ee7387e1f6f1bdd4002b75f47f.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;杨乃武与小白菜案是清末四大疑案之一，案件经过九次审理，最终大白天下。案件的平反昭雪与新闻报道有莫大关系，可算中国历史新闻监督第一案。这个案件错综复杂，既可以窥见人治司法之一斑，也可知晓罪疑惟轻思想很容易导致案件久拖不决。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1J8w1z7EpH</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1J8w1z7EpH</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】有人钻法律漏洞怎么办？如何合理地给法律“补漏”？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116220237975983&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1iecUz7EtE" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/aa9f239a04a8506ecd549272d4ce906c52a53d63.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;当法律出现漏洞，如果导致了一种普遍性的不公平，那就可以期待将来立法机关的法律修改。但是法律修改之前，司法人员应该如何弥补漏洞呢？如果用道德弥补，那只能接受消极道德主义；其次是通过兜底罪弥补，但必须遵循等价值限缩的方法；再次则是通过类推弥补，但只能允许对行为人有利的类推。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iecUz7EtE</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iecUz7EtE</guid><pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】爱民官员办怪案，积极道德主义和消极道德主义区别何在？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116134170861399&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1CLfeBjEAz" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ed240885a74140a7578fc0a35c82780363697960.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;今天给大家讲两个有意思的案子，一个是西汉时期的黄霸戮乱案，另一个是北宋时期的安崇绪诉继母案。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CLfeBjEAz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CLfeBjEAz</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Feb 2026 02:55:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】2025年终总结，如何避免幻灭，获得内心自洽？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116069477916085&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1prZJBuESm" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f48daef6e46eb263414544b9537da4b193c2afde.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;聊聊2025，聊聊最近读的书。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1prZJBuESm</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1prZJBuESm</guid><pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】张三故意服毒“诈”商家，自己进了ICU，“娃娃菜中毒案”的法律分析</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116057884923578&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1pncqztEF7" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/877346132ab5b11cf0035d9ccd0c3098ffe8f434.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;-</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pncqztEF7</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pncqztEF7</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Feb 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item></channel></rss>